    "Terrorists and Counter-Terrorists replace the map's soldiers in a dusty haze; fight your way through.",
    "Use the number keys to switch between the AK-47, Desert Eagle, AWP, M249 and grenades; aim for headshots.",
    "When the Terrorists plant the C4, shoot the bomb to defuse it before it blows, and grab dropped cash.",
